Bundled components
------------------

This release bundles Snort 3 and its runtime dependencies. The main bundled
components and their upstream license families are:

  Component                     License family
  ----------------------------  --------------------------
  Snort 3                       GPL-2.0
  DAQ                           GPL-2.0
  OpenSSL (libcrypto)           Apache-2.0
  libdnet                       BSD
  Hyperscan                     BSD
  hwloc                         BSD
  jemalloc                      BSD
  LuaJIT                        MIT
  liblzma / xz                  Public domain / 0BSD
  libpcap                       BSD
  PCRE2                         BSD
  Snort rule files              Distributed with the Snort source tree

The exact Rust crate dependency versions are recorded in Cargo.lock and
Cargo.toml in the corresponding source tree. License texts for the upstream
components are available from their respective projects and from the Snort 3
source tree at the tag above.

Bundled data
------------

This release bundles the Tranco top-1M domain list (list ID GQ38K-1m) as the
default trusted-domain list.

  Tranco                         https://tranco-list.eu/
  Authors                        Victor Le Pochat, Tom Van Goethem,
                                 Samaneh Tajalizadehkhoob, Maciej Korczynski,
                                 and Wouter Joosen

Tranco aggregates popularity data from third-party providers. See the Tranco
attribution and methodology pages for the upstream data sources and their
terms. The list is used only as local default trust data and is not modified.

